    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\n// Change MODEL to one your Anthropic key can use. The rules below are the agent's hard limits (see n8n/prompts).\nconst MODEL = 'claude-sonnet-5-5';\nconst SYSTEM = `# Risk reviewer (agent prompt)\n\nUsed by \\`risk_review_on_demand.json\\`. A VETO-ONLY reviewer: it can warn or advise skipping a trade; it can never approve one.\n\n**Role.** Challenge a trade the person is considering, using the bundle the bot provides (pre-trade flags, today's loss budget, open positions, recent journal results, live quote).\n\n**Rules (hard):**\n- Use ONLY the data in the bundle. If something is missing, say it is missing.\n- Start with a one-line verdict: \\`SKIP\\`, \\`CAUTION\\` or \\`NO OBJECTION\\`. \\`NO OBJECTION\\` never means \"good trade\" and never means \"approved\"; say that the approval is the human's, in Telegram.\n- Explain each warning flag in plain words and say what it costs.\n- Point out any risk the numbers show: spread share of the stop, loss budget nearly used, an open position already, a losing streak in the journal, a stop smaller than normal noise.\n- Never suggest a bigger size, a wider risk limit, or a different direction. Never predict where price is going; say no tested strategy has shown a proven edge if asked whether it will win.\n- 150 words or fewer.\n\n**Input:** JSON \\`bundle\\` from \\`GET /bundle\\` plus the planned side, stop and target.\n`;\nconst plan = $('Set the trade to review').first().json;\nconst USER = JSON.stringify({ planned: plan, bundle: $json });\nreturn [{ json: { model: MODEL, system: SYSTEM, user: USER } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "7ba0e3e2-0ced-5c69-8c8c-cdaac4131124",
      "name": "Build prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: $json.model, max_tokens: 900, system: $json.system, messages: [{ role: 'user', content: $json.user }] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000
        }
      },
      "id": "c0c3bbbd-e81f-538d-af6e-69f7dc8d6283",
      "name": "Ask the AI (Anthropic)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
